 "_sruntime_listener_basis":"1.21.6 turned PacketSendListener (class_7648) from an interface of send callbacks into a utility class of netty ChannelFutureListener factories, and every send that took one takes a ChannelFutureListener (Connection.send x2, ServerCommonPacketListenerImpl.send, Fabric API PacketSender / LoginPacketSender.sendPacket; javap 1.21.5 / 1.21.6 and fabric-networking-api-v1 4.5.0 / 5.0.1). The facade gives the 1.21.5 interface back; rt/CbPacketListeners turns a 1.21.5 listener into what 1.21.5's Connection did with it on the write's future and back. Calls are redirected, overrides of the old shape hooked (vanilla's netty listener carried as a 1.21.5 listener), their super calls bridged. CenturyBridge's 1.20.5 CbFapiFutureListenerMixin retires: its holder is a ChannelFutureListener doing what the mixin added, and 1.21.6's Connection adds the listener it is given to the write's future itself.",
